<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Chesapeake EPS view cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Chesapeake EPS view cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.P. Morgan said it cut the price target on Chesapeake Energy Corp to $25 from $40. The time frame for the target price was not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Maintains a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Cut fiscal 1997 earnings estimate to $2.19 a share from $2.27 a share. Said cut the fiscal fourth quarter estimate to $0.45 a share from $0.53 a share.</p>
<p>-- Cut the fiscal 1998 estimate to $2.40 a share from $3.05 a share.</p>
<p>-- Chesapeake Energy, the most active issue on the New York Stock Exchange, lost 2-1/16 to 9-7/8.</p>
